# RAWAEA ERP

# CENTRAL INVENTORY & STOCK MOVEMENT

## TARGET DESIGN — V1.0

**Status:** Target Architecture Baseline
**Scope:** Inventory Domain — Manual Stock Vouchers + Central Stock Movement Engine
**Implementation:** Not started
**Database Mutation:** None
**Purpose:** Establish the correct target before repairing the existing implementation.

